      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Conesville%2C_Iowa"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Beebe Stewart Cone previously co-owned a distillery in Conesville, Ohio, before moving to Iowa.",
